# 标准细胞活力实验骨架（AsterML v2）

```asterlab
kind: experiment
id: exp-starter
schema: 1
title: 新建 CCK-8 细胞活力实验
objective: 比较处理组与对照组在不同浓度下的细胞相对活力（OD450）
experimental_unit: well
primary_endpoint: OD450 吸光度
endpoint_method: 酶标仪 450 nm 比色
endpoint_unit: AU
```

```asterlab
kind: group_table
id: gt-starter
schema: 1
title: 实验分组
rows:
  - id: g-control
    name: 阴性对照 (DMEM)
    role: control
    condition: 完全培养基
    independent_n: 3
  - id: g-treat
    name: 材料浸提液组
    role: treatment
    condition: 100% 浸提液 (10 mg/mL)
    independent_n: 3
```

```asterlab
kind: assay
id: assay-main
schema: 1
title: CCK-8 细胞活力检测
endpoint: OD450
unit: AU
group_refs: [g-control, g-treat]
timepoints: [D1]
```

```asterlab
kind: plate
id: plate-starter
schema: 1
format: 96
topology: plate
assay: assay-main
groups:
  g-control: [A1, A2, A3]
  g-treat: [B1, B2, B3]
samples:
  A1: CTL-1
  A2: CTL-2
  A3: CTL-3
  B1: TRT-1
  B2: TRT-2
  B3: TRT-3
roles:
  A1: negative_control
  A2: negative_control
  A3: negative_control
  B1: sample
  B2: sample
  B3: sample
```

```asterlab
kind: step
id: step-seed
schema: 1
execution: executable
title: 01 细胞接种与贴壁培养
assay: assay-main
timepoints: [D1]
path: root/seed
order: 1
blocks:
  - kind: prose
    id: blk-seed-prose
    schema: 1
    title: 接种要点
    tone: note
    body: 96 孔板边缘孔加入 PBS 防蒸发，每孔接种 100 uL 细胞悬液后轻轻十字混匀。
  - kind: param_table
    id: blk-seed-params
    schema: 1
    title: 接种参数
    rows:
      - key: seeding_density
        label: 接种密度
        value: 5000
        unit: cells/well
      - key: well_volume
        label: 每孔体积
        value: 100
        unit: uL
  - kind: checklist
    id: blk-seed-chk
    schema: 1
    title: 接种核查
    items:
      - id: chk-uniform
        label: 镜下确认细胞分布均匀、无明显聚团
        blocking: true
```

```asterlab
kind: step
id: step-read
schema: 1
execution: executable
title: 02 加入 CCK-8 孵育与 OD450 读数
assay: assay-main
timepoints: [D1]
path: root/read
order: 2
blocks:
  - kind: timer
    id: blk-cck8-timer
    schema: 1
    title: CCK-8 避光显色孵育
    mode: countdown
    duration: {value: 2, unit: h}
  - kind: data_table
    id: blk-cck8-od
    schema: 1
    title: 酶标仪 OD450 原始与相对活力表
    schema_id: cck8_od450
    endpoint: OD450
    columns:
      - key: well
        label: 孔位
        value_kind: text
      - key: od450
        label: OD450
        value_kind: number
        unit: AU
        min: 0.1
        max: 3.5
      - key: blank
        label: 空白背景
        value_kind: number
        unit: AU
      - key: net_od
        label: 净吸光度
        value_kind: formula
        formula: "od450 - blank"
        unit: AU
```

```asterlab
kind: workflow
id: wf-starter
schema: 1
steps: [step-seed, step-read]
edges:
  - from: step-seed
    to: step-read
```
